{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "848c1d70-599a-84aa-9a9e-256271468421",
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T10:11:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nilson Spencer",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:08:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:08:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. Um, I'm calling about a license. For a food truck. I'm not even sure I'm calling the right office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:08:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, you're in the right neighborhood. Licensing runs through us for a lot of things. Tell me what you've got in mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:08:29-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I'd want to park it down on the waterfront, you know, by the harbor where all the tourists walk. Sell cabinets. Sorry, milkshakes. You say cabinet, it's a milkshake, a Rhode Island thing, with the coffee syrup and the ice cream and the milk. Anyway, that kind of stuff. Is that a license I get from you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:08:49-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know exactly what you mean, I grew up saying it too. So, a mobile food vendor license, yes, that's something we handle. Where you're allowed to park on the waterfront is a separate question, though, and there may be other approvals, like the health side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:09:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, wait. So that's two different things? The license and the spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:09:10-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Kind of, yes. The license says you can operate as a vendor. The location rules say where. Some waterfront areas are restricted, some are city property, some are private. So you'd want to know the exact spot you're thinking of."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:09:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Huh. I thought the license was the spot. Like you get the license, you get a place to park."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:09:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, a lot of people think that. The license doesn't hand you a space."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:09:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Got it. Sort of. So then, how long is it good for? Like once I have it, is it a year, or do I have to do it every season, or what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:09:49-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally those licenses are annual, so you'd renew it each year. But let me not tell you the exact dates, because I'd want you to get the real paperwork. Let me check how ours is set up. Can you hold a second?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:10:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sure, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:10:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, I'm back. So it's an annual license, and it runs for the year, not by the season. So if you start in the spring, you'd still renew when the year is up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:10:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's not from when I get it. It's, like, a calendar thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:10:23-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't say for sure whether it counts from the day you're approved or from a set date. That's one I'd have the licensing staff confirm. I can take your name and number and have someone call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:10:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, okay. Sorry, I'm all mixed up, I thought this would be one form. It's Nilson Spencer. S-P-E-N-C-E-R. And the number is 401-555-0163."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:10:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nilson Spencer, 401-555-0163. Got it. Is that a home line? Is a morning better or afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:10:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Home, yeah, landline. Mornings are better. Afternoons I'm running around, my kid lost a jacket at school again. Third one this year. So I'm going to go look for it, or buy another one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:11:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no. They do that, don't they? Check the lost and found, that's where mine always turned up. Okay, so I'll put in a note for a morning call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:11:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. And just so I have it straight, I need the license, and then separately the spot, and maybe the health thing. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:11:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the gist, yes. Someone will walk you through which ones apply."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:11:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I think I understand. Mostly. Thanks, Sandra."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:11:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Nilson. Good luck with the jacket, and the cabinets."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:11:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, thanks. Bye now."
    }
  ],
